sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Eureka as eureka-server
    participant SCG as api-gateway
    participant Chat as chat-service
    participant AI as ai-gateway
    participant Calc as calculation-service
    participant SBA as spring-boot-admin

    Note over Eureka: Starts first (compose depends_on healthy)

    SCG->>Eureka: POST /eureka/apps/API-GATEWAY (register)
    Chat->>Eureka: POST /eureka/apps/CHAT-SERVICE (register)
    AI->>Eureka: POST /eureka/apps/AI-GATEWAY (register)
    Calc->>Eureka: POST /eureka/apps/CALCULATION-SERVICE (register)
    SBA->>Eureka: POST /eureka/apps/SPRING-BOOT-ADMIN (register)

    Note over SBA,Eureka: SBA both registers itself and pulls the registry to discover monitored services.
    SBA->>Eureka: GET /eureka/apps (discover instances)
    Eureka-->>SBA: registry snapshot

    Note over SCG,Eureka: SCG resolves lb://chat-service via Eureka at request time.
    SCG->>Eureka: GET /eureka/apps/CHAT-SERVICE
    Eureka-->>SCG: instance list (host:port)
    SCG->>Chat: forward request

    loop heartbeat every 30s
        SCG->>Eureka: PUT /eureka/apps/API-GATEWAY/{instance}
        Chat->>Eureka: PUT /eureka/apps/CHAT-SERVICE/{instance}
        AI->>Eureka: PUT /eureka/apps/AI-GATEWAY/{instance}
        Calc->>Eureka: PUT /eureka/apps/CALCULATION-SERVICE/{instance}
        SBA->>Eureka: PUT /eureka/apps/SPRING-BOOT-ADMIN/{instance}
    end
